docs/ARCHITECTURE.md:52:- Service methods follow a "throw on not found" pattern: `getById`, `getByEmployeeNumber`, `getByEmail`, `getByLeaveType` all throw `NotFoundError` rather than returning `null`. Existence-check methods (`isActive`, `isLeaveTypeActive`) diverge: `isActive` throws for nonexistent employees; `isLeaveTypeActive` returns `false` for nonexistent policies.
